{#- Optional feed-supplied image. "Graphical abstract" only when the feed declared
    it (display_figure sets the label); every other image is an "Article image".
    Nothing renders without an image: no empty frame, no "not found" chip.
    The image is fetched only when the reader opens this disclosure, without a
    referrer, and first without cookies (crossorigin=anonymous); a host that
    refuses that CORS request gets one plain image request. The loader in _base.html.j2
    keys on .figure-link, img[data-src], .figure-unavailable and .figure-retry;
    the cached reading view reads the summary text before " · ". -#}
{% if item.figure %}
{% set figure = item.figure %}
<details class="article-figure" data-figure-kind="{{ figure.kind | default('article_preview') }}">
  <summary><span class="figure-label">{{ figure.label }}</span> · <span class="figure-hint figure-show">show image</span><span class="figure-hint figure-hide">hide image</span></summary>
  <p class="figure-hint">Showing it loads the image from the publisher’s host, without a referrer. Images never affect ranking.</p>
  <figure>
    <a class="figure-link" href="{{ figure.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" aria-label="Open {{ figure.label|lower }} full size for {{ item.title }}">
      <img data-src="{{ figure.url }}" alt="{{ figure.alt or figure.label }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" crossorigin="anonymous">
    </a>
    <figcaption>{{ figure.label }} supplied in the {{ item.source or 'publisher' }} feed · <a class="figure-full" href="{{ figure.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">Open full size</a> · <a href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Article and image credit</a>.
      <span class="figure-unavailable" role="status" hidden>The image host did not allow an embedded preview. <button type="button" class="figure-retry">Retry image</button> or <a href="{{ figure.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">open it directly</a>.</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
</details>
{% endif %}
